e\">big</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Small_candle\" title=\"Small candle\">small candles</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This item (like all the other candles) can be dyed.</li>\n<li>When interacted with, it can be lit up with [f] [image needed]</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163653\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 65/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019472/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.813      1 Template:Axe\n100.00%   27.813      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4511-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163653 and revision id 19910. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Items","Event_Items"],"links":[{"title":"Big Candle","exists":true},{"title":"Halloween Popper","exists":true},{"title":"Small candle","exists":true},{"title":"The Monstrous Manor","exists":true}],"images":["Missing_Image.png"]}
